        {
          "text": "omu momuli cipaililo cangolida, alimwi muli Ibbokesi lya-Mulongo livumbidwe ingolida yalo mubili woonse, nkabela mukati kalyo muli cibiya cangolida cijisi Mana, amusako wa-Arone uwakasonsa, amabwe aakulembela Mulongo. ",
          "type": "text",
