                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbuboobo Muuya Uusalala mbwafundisya kuti inzila iiya mu-Busena Busalalisya cakwiinda tiina kujuka, mbociciimvwi cikombelo citaanzi, ",
          "type": "text",
