        },
        {
          "text": "Pele eno Kristo wakasika mbuli Mupaizi Mupati wacoolwe ciciza, wakaindilila akunjila mucikombelo cimwi cipati cini cilomene, icatakayakwa amaanza aabantu, nkokuti taceensi caansi ano, ",
          "type": "text",
