              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nkabela taakwe naakatola bulowa bwampongo nobuba bwaŋombe, wakatola bulowa bwakwe mwini, eno wakaindilila akunjila komwe luzutu mu-Busena Busalalisya cakwiinda aboobo wakaleta lununuko lutamani. ",
          "type": "text",
