        {
          "text": "Eno nkaambo kamakani aya walo ncaaba Sikwiimaakati wa-Mulongo mupya, kuti abo abakaitwa bakatambule lukono lutamani olo ulwakasyomezegwa, nkaambo lufu mpoluli lubanununa kukusotoka milao kwamumulongo wakusaanguna. ",
