          "text": "Nkaambo Musa naakamana kulailila bantu boonse makani oonse aa-Mulao, wakabweza bulowa bwaboombe abwampongo, antoomwe amaanzi aboya busalala tyu ahisopo, wakabusansaila kubbuku akubantu boonse, ",
