        {
          "text": "Nkaambo Kristo teewakanjila mu-Busena Busalala ubwakayakwa amaanza aabantu (ncifwanisyo buyo cabusena bwinibwini), pe, wakanjila kujulu kwini buya, kuti akapompe kubusyu bwa-Leza nkaambo kandiswe, ",
